WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The word says blue. The ink says something else.
Which instruction gets your answer?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
In 1935, J. Ridley Stroop measured how a familiar
reading response competes with naming color.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The result is about a specific task. It cannot prove
a meditation recording trains your whole brain.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 is sold as a structured audio library.
Its convenience may matter; its biggest outcome
claims need independent proof.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try a free twelve-minute start.
Then decide whether any audio is worth paying for.
